# ==============================================================================
# ChatSphare Frontend — Environment Notice
# ==============================================================================
# All environment variables for both Frontend and Backend are centralized in the
# root `.env` file at the repository root (`../.env`).
#
# Vite is configured to load directly from the root directory (`envDir: '..'`).
# To configure frontend variables (such as VITE_FIREBASE_* and VITE_API_TARGET),
# edit the root `.env` file directly.
# ==============================================================================
